    {
      "id": "OUT03",
      "finding": "DropOnFloor attempts Near placement of EVERY generated product at the actor position and ends the job Succeeded. Zero products also ends Succeeded. Placement failures are logged; this is not a guarantee that arbitrary blocked maps accept every product.",
