    {
      "id": "OUT05",
      "finding": "After a cell is found, MaxStackSpaceEver is min(def.stackLimit, rounded CarryingCapacity/VolumePerUnit). Excess from products[0] is split off and attempted Near the maker; capacity0 ends Succeeded. Otherwise TryStartCarry then direct HaulToCellStorageJob and StartJob keepCarryingThingOverride=true. This path does not consult ordinary Haul priority; dead/downed and capacity constraints still exist.",
