      "id": "OUT06",
      "finding": "Best calls TryFindBestBetterStoreCellFor from Unstored, scanning registered slot groups in priority order. It requires priority above current and not below a found priority, matching faction for Thing parents, and HaulDestinationEnabled. Production uses the cell/slot-group search, not the broader non-slot container search.",
