      "finding": "Specific calls TryFindBestBetterStoreCellForIn on its ISlotGroup directly, without Best outer priority/faction/enabled loop. Shared worker rejects null or actual-Thing filter mismatch, then searches CellsList. Distance is horizontal squared distance and the loop can stop after a small randomized fraction; not guaranteed global nearest or minimum path cost.",
      "sources": [
