      "id": "OUT11",
      "finding": "HaulToCell skips pickup when already carrying targetA, reserves its targets, and checks destination storage validity while carrying. Group removal, changed filter or capacity can fail an en-route job. Generic cleanup clears reservations and conditionally drops carried contents Near unless job policy/override retains them; this is distinct from initial output selection.",
