    {
      "id": "OUT12",
      "finding": "At-place Direct drop failure or partial placement can try another Best storage cell, then haul-aside; the default tryStoreSame=false does not constrain remainder to the original Specific group. In the extreme no-place branch the original destroys the carried item and logs a warning. Web cargo-preservation/drop-near failure handling is an adaptation, not an exact copy of this fallback tree.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "group": "work",
          "type": "Verse.AI.Toils_Haul",
